    <briefdescription>
<para>Complete SOC 2 Type II evidence bundle for a given time window. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Aggregates all four evidence categories required by the security ROADMAP:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Audit log export</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Metrics snapshot</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Key-rotation records</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Access-control report</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>The bundle includes a retention verification flag that indicates whether the collected evidence falls within the configured 12-month retention window.</para>
<para>Evidence of network control configuration for SOC 2 audit.</para>
<para>Captures TLS cipher suites, mTLS-enabled shard count, and rate-limiter configuration snapshot. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
